# Nechto — agent context

Art-space platform for Belarus. Node **>= 22.18**.

## Stack

- `apps/web` — Next.js 16 (App Router) + React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4 + TypeScript + next-intl (ru default, en)
- `apps/api` — NestJS 11 + TypeScript (`module`/`moduleResolution`: `nodenext`) + Prisma + Zod env
- `packages/api-contract` + `packages/api-client` — web/API boundary
- PostgreSQL 16 and local storage via Docker Compose

## Non-negotiable boundaries

- Web calls API through `@nechto/api-client`; request/response types live in `@nechto/api-contract`.
- Auth uses JWT httpOnly cookies + `JwtAuthGuard`; never expose secrets or plaintext passwords.
- RSC session reads use `lib/session.ts` + cookie forwarding in `lib/api-server.ts`.
- Uploads use `StorageService`; no ad-hoc disk/cloud access in feature modules.
- UI copy is ru+en through next-intl; source comments are English.
- Keep changes scoped; no drive-by refactors
- Format with Prettier (`prettier.config.mjs`); do not fight it with manual style diffs

After package edits or branch switches, run `npm run build:packages` so Docker
bind mounts have current `dist/`.
